[8097]="70030EF5\n1\tRecupera pescado de los Orcos (total: 8)\tLos muelles se encuentran al sureste de Río Nevado. Sigeric está preocupado por la salud de la ciudad y desea que recuperes pescado de los Orcos que han sido vistos cerca de los muelles de Río Nevado.\n2\tHabla con Gísling\tGísling se encuentra en el norte de Río Nevado. Sigeric te dijo que llevaras el pescado que recogiste a Gísling.\n",
[8098]="7006C6E7\n1\tSpeak with Ashâmi at her post near Raphûz in Ub Nishir\tRaphûz thanked you for your guidance and camaraderie through his journey. He aspires to be like you now. He added that you should speak with Ashâmi, also in Ub Nishir, as she wants to speak with you too.\n2\tSpeak with Raphûz at his post near Ashâmi in Ub Nishir\tAshâmi credits you with making her a better person and guiding her and Raphûz into the relationship and fate they have chosen. Raphûz had mentioned you should return to him at Ub Nishir after speaking with Ashâmi.\n",
[8099]="70054672\n1\tFire loaded ballistae (total: 7)\tLoaded ballistae can be found in the Circle of Madness. You should fire loaded ballistae at flying merrevail.\n2\tHabla con Rhadrog\tRhadrog is stationed inside Barad Elenath, the Star-gazers' Spire. You should talk to Rhadrog.\n",
[8100]="7005AB12\n1\tDefeat goblin looters (total: 6)\tGoblin looters have been spotted stealing from the ice-giants in Thyrstáth. You should defeat goblin looters.\n2\tCall Hórin and talk to him or speak to him back at Fellgát\tUse the summoning horn to call Hórin to your side. You should talk to Hórin. If Hórin is no longer with you, you can find him at Fellgát.\n",
[8101]="70000D8E\n1\tHabla con Hyacinth Took\tHyacinth Tuk está en Alforzaburgo, al oeste de los Grandes Smials. Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón ha oído que Hyacinth Tuk sabe hacer fuegos artificiales y te ha pedido que le hagas un pedido de los más grandes y brillantes.\n2\tHabla con Lobelia Sackville-Baggins\tLobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón está en su casa de Bolsón Cerrado, en Hobbiton. Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón te ha pedido que hagas un pedido de fuegos artificiales a Hyacinth Tuk, pero Hyacinth te ha informado de que no le quedan ni fuegos artificiales ni los materiales para hacerlos. Te ha dicho que vuelvas a Hobbiton y te asegures de que Lobelia tendrá que pagar por los materiales, si todavía quiere fuegos artificiales.\n3\tLleva la bolsa de monedas a Hyacinth Tuk\tHyacinth Tuk está al oeste de los Grandes Smials, en Alforzaburgo. Hyacinth Tuk te ha pedido que vuelvas a ver a Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón para exigirle el pago de los ingredientes para hacer sus fuegos artificiales. Lobelia ha accedido a regañadientes y te ha dado una bolsa de monedas para que se la lleves a Hyacinth.\n",
[8102]="70000D07\n1\tRecoge la tarta\tOpal Buenavista está en el Campo de la fiesta, al norte de Hobbiton y al sur de Bolsón Cerrado. Cuando volviste de entregar una tarta al Dragón Verde, Holly Corneta tenía otra tarea de entrega esperándote: te ha pedido que lleves la tarta que preparó para la fiesta de cumpleaños de Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón a Opal Buenavista en el Campo de la fiesta de Hobbiton, al sur de Bolsón Cerrado y al norte del pueblo. Asegúrate de que ningún hobbit hambriento huela la tarta, o vendrán a molestar a Holly para que les dé una porción. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n2\tHabla con Holly Hornblower\tHolly Corneta se encuentra al norte de la plaza principal de Hobbiton y al sur del Campo de la fiesta. Cuando entregaste la tarta a Opal Buenavista, ella la probó y descubrió que sabía horrible. Le exigió a Holly Corneta que le preparara otra. Deberías volver con Holly enseguida.\n",
[8103]="7005F6BC\n1\tDefeat Angmarim of the Iron Crown at Lochan Dúv\tAngmarim of the Iron Crown can be found at Lochan Dúv in Gloomingtarn. Lochan Dúv is the chief encampment of the Iron Crown in Gloomingtarn. You should defeat Angmarim of the Iron Crown and drive them from Mount Gundabad.\n2\tDefeat Angmarim of the Iron Crown at Lochan Dúv (total: 12)\tAngmarim of the Iron Crown can be found at Lochan Dúv in Gloomingtarn. Lochan Dúv is the chief encampment of the Iron Crown in Gloomingtarn. You should defeat Angmarim of the Iron Crown and drive them from Mount Gundabad.\n3\tCompletado\tYou have defeated many Angmarim of the Iron Crown at Lochan Dúv.\n",
[8104]="70047DB5\n1\tObtain a lock-pick and open the Udûn-cast strongbox\tUdûn-cast Strongboxes can be found somewhere in the depths of Skoironk or within the Towers of the Teeth.\n2\tObtain a lock-pick and open the Udûn-cast strongbox\tUdûn-cast strongboxes can be found somewhere in the depths of Skoironk or within the Towers of the Teeth. If you have a lock-pick, you should attempt to open the strongbox.\n",
[8105]="70047DBC\n1\tObtain a lock-pick and open the Udûn-cast Strongbox\tUdûn-cast strongboxes can be found somewhere in the depths of Skoironk or within the Towers of the Teeth.\n2\tObtain a lock-pick and open the Udûn-cast strongbox\tUdûn-cast strongboxes can be found somewhere in the depths of Skoironk or within the Towers of the Teeth. If you have a lock-pick, you should attempt to open the strongbox.\n",
[8106]="700490FF\n1\tObtain a lock-pick and open the Udûn-cast strongbox\tUdûn-cast strongboxes can be found somewhere in the depths of Skoironk or within the Towers of the Teeth.\n2\tObtain a lock-pick and open the Udûn-cast strongbox\tUdûn-cast strongboxes can be found somewhere in the depths of Skoironk or within the Towers of the Teeth. If you have a lock-pick, you should attempt to open the strongbox.\n",
[8107]="70049100\n1\tObtain a lock-pick and open the Udûn-cast strongbox\tUdûn-cast strongboxes can be found somewhere in the depths of Skoironk or within the Towers of the Teeth.\n2\tObtain a lock-pick and open the Udûn-cast strongbox\tUdûn-cast strongboxes can be found somewhere in the depths of Skoironk or within the Towers of the Teeth. If you have a lock-pick, you should attempt to open the strongbox.\n",
[8108]="7003FE68\n1\tLock chests (total: 6)\tThe chests within the mason should be locked to prevent the corsairs from getting the contents within.\n",
[8109]="70065E94\n1\tTell Gladion you will help him with his work\tGladion is at his farm in northern Lamedon. Speak with Gladion about the help he needs on his farm.\n2\tRepair the squeaky chairs (total: 2)\030Repair the broken ladder (cantidad: según el diario)\tGladion's farm is in northern Lamedon. Repair damaged furniture at Gladion's farm.\n3\tAsk Gladion what else he needs\tGladion is at his farm in northern Lamedon. Speak with Gladion about the help he needs on his farm.\n4\tArranca las malas hierbas (total: 5)\030Pick stones (total: 6)\tWeeds and stones can be found on Gladion's family's farmland. Pick weeds and stones from Gladion's farmland.\n5\tReturn to Gladion\tGladion is at his farm in northern Lamedon. You should return to Gladion.\n",
[8110]="7003FE3A\n1\tTell Gladion you will help him with his work\tGladion is at his farm in northern Lamedon. You should speak with Gladion about the help he needs on his farm.\n2\tRepair the squeaky chairs (total: 2)\030Repair the broken ladder (cantidad: según el diario)\tGladion's farm is in northern Lamedon. You should repair damaged furniture at Gladion's farm.\n3\tAsk Gladion what else he needs\tGladion is at his farm in northern Lamedon. You should speak with Gladion about the help he needs on his farm.\n4\tHarvest wheat from the fields (total: 3)\030Pick cabbages (total: 5)\030Collect the carrots for delivery (cantidad: según el diario)\tThe wheat and cabbages can be harvested from the fields at Gladion's farmstead. The crate of carrots is on Gladion's farm, and should be carried to the Calembel-bound waggon in the centre of the village. You should harvest the crops and carry the carrots to the waggon.\n5\tReturn to Gladion\tGladion is at his farm in northern Lamedon. You should return to Gladion.\n",
[8111]="70025C03\n1\tRecolecta troncos secos (total: 8)\tNan Orngon está al este de Ost Forod. Poppy Silleras te ha pedido que te aventures en Nan Orngon y recojas troncos secos.\n2\tLleva troncos secos a Poppy Silleras en Ost Forod\tPoppy Silleras está en Ost Forod, al oeste de Nan Orngon. Poppy Silleras se alegrará de ver toda la leña que has recogido.\n",
[8112]="7005CE67\n1\tTalk to Kyrstig near the Houses of Rest\tYou should find Kyrstig and help investigate the Houses of Rest.\n2\tComplete 'Discovery: Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest'\tYou should seek out the entrance to Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest.\n3\tComplete Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest, on any difficulty\tYou should complete Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest, on any difficulty.\n4\tTalk to Kyrstig in Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest\tYou should report to Kyrstig at once.\n5\tTalk to Scout-master Ausma\tAusma is waiting for your report.\n",
[8113]="7000186C\n1\tHabla con Londrandir\tLondrandir está en la granja de Gatson en la Dehesa del Rey. Deberías hablar con Londrandir.\n2\tHabla con Lachenn o Aglardir en Meluinen\tLachenn y Aglardir están en Lin Giliath en Meluinen, al sur de Esteldín. Como está claro que los Montaraces tienen sus propias cargas, Londrandir te ha pedido que viajes al este para hablar con Lachenn, el Maestro de Lin Giliath. Si Lachenn no está disponible, te indicó que hablaras con Aglardir.\n",
[8114]="7002542E\n1\tHabla con Ransroth\tHabla con Ransroth para ganar reputación.\n",
[8115]="70025430\n1\tHabla con Ransroth\tHabla con Ransroth para ganar reputación.\n",
